WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:02.220
I got lost!

00:02.220 --> 00:05.770
The garden here at 
Hazelita's house is so big.

00:05.770 --> 00:09.560
The one who said she wanted to look around 
while Hazelita was having her lessons...

00:09.560 --> 00:11.450
was you, wasn't it, Lady Saint?

00:12.640 --> 00:14.210
Don't worry.

00:14.210 --> 00:16.840
I've made sure to remember the way back.

00:18.200 --> 00:19.640
Mister Giselbert?

00:19.640 --> 00:21.490
Hey there, you two.

00:21.490 --> 00:23.610
What are you doing here?

00:23.610 --> 00:25.340
Hm? Oh.

00:25.340 --> 00:28.620
Just a little something with the correspondence 
regarding marriage offers for Hazelita.

00:30.590 --> 00:32.960
Isn't it bad to do that to them?

00:32.960 --> 00:34.190
It's fine.

00:34.190 --> 00:36.480
There isn't anyone serious among them.

00:37.220 --> 00:39.470
How many times have I asked you 
to stop burning them?!

00:40.790 --> 00:42.600
You haven't written any 
replies to them either.

00:42.600 --> 00:44.340
Please take them back with you.

00:46.120 --> 00:49.570
Will the two of you help me carry them?

02:21.240 --> 02:24.990
Episode 9

02:21.240 --> 02:24.990
Lady Saint's Divine Protection

02:25.650 --> 02:27.990
Please leave the bag anywhere over here.

02:28.300 --> 02:30.750
This room is full of books!

02:32.060 --> 02:35.260
Hazelita and a blonde lady?

02:35.260 --> 02:38.510
Is this Lady Saint Frederica?

02:39.190 --> 02:42.600
You could see her divine 
protection, but not her form?

02:43.080 --> 02:47.260
Only beautiful blonde hair that 
looked like sunlight shone through it.

02:47.260 --> 02:49.300
Is that how it works?

02:49.300 --> 02:50.500
Excuse me.

02:50.890 --> 02:53.520
What is divine protection anyway?

02:54.870 --> 02:58.480
I mean, I heard something vague about 
it from my grandfather, but...

02:58.480 --> 03:00.040
Miss Cecilia,

03:00.040 --> 03:02.500
he's a person you should 
explain it to, don't you think?

03:03.160 --> 03:06.670
And, Lawrence, if you're going to 
stay by Miss Cecilia's side,

03:06.670 --> 03:08.990
then it's better to have 
a firm understanding of it, isn't it?

03:08.990 --> 03:10.410
Of course.

03:10.410 --> 03:12.570
If it's about the Lady Saint, 
I want to know every detail.

03:14.580 --> 03:16.460
There goes the Cecilia-killer.

03:17.900 --> 03:19.960
To begin with,

03:19.960 --> 03:23.050
lady saints are meant to make this world, 
and the lives of its people, richer.

03:23.050 --> 03:25.720
They are women who have received 
divine revelation for that purpose.

03:26.180 --> 03:30.400
There are records of them
living everywhere in every era.

03:30.400 --> 03:32.560
Even now, aside from the lady saint,

03:32.560 --> 03:34.600
there are some living here 
and there, aren't there?

03:34.600 --> 03:37.440
Yes, though I've never met them.

03:37.830 --> 03:42.400
Lady saints were once treated as gods,

03:42.400 --> 03:47.460
but now most of them live lives that aren't 
so different from those of most people.

03:47.960 --> 03:51.880
I pray that they really do live that way.

03:53.280 --> 03:57.420
But when it comes to the Great 
Lady Saint, that isn't everything.

03:57.880 --> 04:00.670
The Great Lady Saint 
represents all the lady saints,

04:00.670 --> 04:04.610
and as someone who protects not just 
the people, but also the lady saints,

04:04.610 --> 04:09.400
she lives on Michela Island's holy ground 
and offers up prayers every day.

04:09.400 --> 04:11.020
Have you ever been there?

04:11.020 --> 04:14.140
It's a beautiful place, 
looking out on the vast ocean.

04:14.140 --> 04:15.900
The ocean?

04:15.900 --> 04:19.850
That island has the Great Lady 
Saint's divine protection on it.

04:20.520 --> 04:24.320
Divine protection is one of the miracles 
that lady saints can create.

04:24.810 --> 04:28.480
When a lady saint prays for the 
protection of another person or object...

04:28.480 --> 04:31.830
it's said that their prayers 
become real, just as they wish.

04:31.830 --> 04:33.120
For example,

04:33.120 --> 04:36.500
if one prayed that another person 
didn't get sick or hurt... You see?

04:37.250 --> 04:40.500
That's exactly what happened 
with you, Mister Giselbert.

04:40.500 --> 04:43.640
Of course, the effects aren't absolute,

04:43.640 --> 04:45.760
and there are things we aren't able to do.

04:45.760 --> 04:49.390
The strong divine protection that Lady Saint 
Frederica bestowed on the two of them...

04:49.390 --> 04:52.140
that isn't something we can usually do.

04:52.140 --> 04:53.420
I thought not.

04:53.420 --> 04:55.260
If something like that were easy,

04:55.260 --> 04:58.400
it would be difficult 
for lady saints to live normal lives.

04:58.400 --> 05:01.130
I suppose that anyone 
who gets deeply involved

05:01.130 --> 05:03.640
with a lady saint 
has much entrusted to them.

05:03.640 --> 05:05.150
Wow.

05:05.150 --> 05:09.310
Lady Saint, is there anything 
in particular that you protect?

05:09.310 --> 05:11.210
The church, for example.

05:11.210 --> 05:17.290
A-And I protect you, too, Lawren.

05:17.290 --> 05:20.760
You do? Thank you so much!

05:20.760 --> 05:24.300
<i>Though it's very different 
from the way I protect other people!</i>

05:24.300 --> 05:26.680
It's just, um...

05:26.680 --> 05:30.240
the effects of divine protection 
are a little complicated.

05:30.240 --> 05:32.400
With Lawren's headache yesterday,

05:32.400 --> 05:35.850
my divine protection and Lady 
Saint Frederica's overlapped,

05:35.850 --> 05:38.990
which I believe made 
the overall effect too strong.

05:39.630 --> 05:41.160
I see.

05:41.730 --> 05:43.890
That means that a prayer 
to protect something...

05:43.890 --> 05:46.690
is a very powerful thing, doesn't it?

05:48.350 --> 05:49.440
Yes!

05:49.440 --> 05:50.570
Now that I think about it,

05:50.570 --> 05:52.040
in the time we've been together,

05:52.040 --> 05:54.940
you haven't spoken 
of anything in detail with me.

05:54.940 --> 05:56.830
Th-That's because...

05:56.830 --> 06:01.190
at first, I thought I could just 
tell you all the details later,

06:01.190 --> 06:03.280
but the longer we lived together...

06:03.280 --> 06:05.400
Showing my lady saint side to you puts

06:05.400 --> 06:08.420
a distance between us 
that I don't want to be there.

06:08.420 --> 06:09.990
After all this time, 
you're worried about that?

06:10.550 --> 06:14.160
I know that you are special, Lady Saint.

06:14.160 --> 06:19.060
And I look at you not just 
as a lady saint, but also as a person.

06:19.060 --> 06:21.590
Being a lady saint is one aspect of you,

06:21.590 --> 06:24.400
but no one would put distance between 
themselves and someone important to them.

06:24.400 --> 06:25.770
Exactly right.

06:25.770 --> 06:26.400
Right?

06:26.400 --> 06:28.650
In similar situations

06:27.180 --> 06:28.650
B-But!

06:28.650 --> 06:32.570
Lawren, you always call me 
"Lady Saint," don't you?

06:32.570 --> 06:35.620
Isn't that you putting distance 
between us because I'm a lady saint?

06:35.620 --> 06:36.390
What?

06:36.390 --> 06:39.550
I told you I'd work on that, didn't I?

06:40.650 --> 06:43.320
Then, this means that 
other than what you call her,

06:43.320 --> 06:46.060
you treat her like a regular girl?

06:46.690 --> 06:50.140
Th-That's right.

06:51.170 --> 06:52.690
I am content.

06:52.690 --> 06:53.920
Why?

06:54.250 --> 06:58.200
I don't know much about 
the Great Lady Saint at all,

06:58.200 --> 07:01.720
but you seem very knowledgeable 
about her, Mister Giselbert.

07:01.720 --> 07:06.100
Well, even now, I'm still involved 
with the Great Lady Saint.

07:06.730 --> 07:09.000
I undertook some work for her, you see?

07:09.000 --> 07:13.050
I'm investigating whether the lady saints 
in different areas are living peaceful lives.

07:13.050 --> 07:15.060
That's how I found out about you two.

07:15.060 --> 07:16.740
I see.

07:17.470 --> 07:22.410
I don't want for there to be any 
more lady saints like Frederica.

07:23.920 --> 07:25.930
This work you're doing...

07:25.930 --> 07:28.440
You haven't told Miss Hazelita 
about it, have you?

07:28.440 --> 07:31.260
Are you sure it's all right to have told us?

07:31.740 --> 07:33.760
I'm not sure what it is...

07:33.760 --> 07:35.680
but when I see the two of you,

07:35.680 --> 07:39.060
it feels rather underhanded 
to explain things away.

07:39.060 --> 07:41.130
You could say you dazzle me.

07:41.130 --> 07:43.760
I suppose the closeness 
between you rubbed off on me.

07:44.770 --> 07:48.360
Lawren, we look like we're 
close with each other!

07:48.360 --> 07:50.160
Do we?

07:50.160 --> 07:55.280
After all, when I speak to Miss Cecilia, 
you direct your wariness at me.

07:55.280 --> 07:58.200
I don't mean to do that,

07:58.200 --> 08:01.290
but it's true that I feel 
a sense of uneasiness for some reason.

08:01.290 --> 08:04.910
If I hadn't touched Miss Cecilia 
when we first met,

08:04.910 --> 08:06.960
you probably wouldn't feel that way!

08:06.970 --> 08:08.190
Really?

08:08.190 --> 08:12.040
Even after saying all of this... 
You still don't get it, do you?

08:12.770 --> 08:14.040
Now, then.

08:14.040 --> 08:17.600
What to do with all these 
marriage offer letters.

08:19.090 --> 08:20.930
H-Hazelita?!

08:20.930 --> 08:23.070
A-Are your lessons over already?

08:23.070 --> 08:25.460
These letters really have nothing 
to do with you, so—

08:25.460 --> 08:26.580
Dear brother...

08:26.580 --> 08:29.940
I saw Cecilia and Lawrence 
coming out of this room.

08:30.250 --> 08:32.600
You didn't say anything strange 
to them, did you?

08:32.600 --> 08:34.520
Why would you ask me something like that?

08:34.520 --> 08:39.260
Because you've always said 
the most outrageous things.

08:39.260 --> 08:42.370
Why are you so concerned for them?

08:42.370 --> 08:46.620
While I was over there, 
they took very good care of me.

08:46.620 --> 08:48.130
Besides which...

08:48.130 --> 08:50.090
for the two of us,

08:50.090 --> 08:53.350
a lady saint's happiness is more 
important than anything else, isn't it?

08:53.630 --> 08:56.060
Yes, that's true.

08:56.960 --> 08:58.650
I feel that way, too.

08:59.180 --> 09:03.010
By the way, are all those 
letters addressed to you?

09:03.010 --> 09:05.510
You certainly have let 
them pile up, haven't you?

09:05.510 --> 09:07.580
Oh, um...yes.

09:09.250 --> 09:11.130
No open fires.

09:09.610 --> 09:12.030
No open fires.

09:12.560 --> 09:16.030
Laze...

09:13.070 --> 09:16.030
Hazelita after lessons.

09:16.760 --> 09:18.920
When we said we're leaving tomorrow...

09:18.920 --> 09:20.670
they not only held a party...

09:20.780 --> 09:23.920
they also readied all this food. 
Will we be able to eat it all?

09:23.920 --> 09:26.980
Makes me want to leave it to you, 
Eric, since you're a growing boy.

09:26.980 --> 09:28.580
I don't eat much.

09:28.580 --> 09:30.220
Hey! Oh, good!

09:30.220 --> 09:31.330
I made it in time.

09:31.330 --> 09:32.260
Hein?

09:32.260 --> 09:33.990
Thank you for coming!

09:33.990 --> 09:35.950
I was happy to be invited!

09:35.950 --> 09:40.480
But should I have come in better clothes?

09:40.480 --> 09:43.720
No, I was forced 
to dress like this, that's all.

09:43.720 --> 09:44.840
The maids said,

09:44.840 --> 09:47.200
"Why are the ladies 
the only ones dressing up?"

09:47.200 --> 09:48.890
That's why we're all dressed up.

09:48.890 --> 09:51.380
Are the ladies still getting ready?

09:51.380 --> 09:54.440
The lady doesn't like dressing up, you know?

09:54.440 --> 09:56.400
After having to keep them 
in check all the time,

09:56.400 --> 09:58.070
the maids' desires are about to explode.

09:59.070 --> 10:03.800
That's only because the maids' tastes 
and mine do not align.

10:03.800 --> 10:05.830
Yikes. When did you get here?

10:06.280 --> 10:07.520
What's this?

10:07.520 --> 10:10.200
Miss Hazelita, you seem like 
you're quite excited about this.

10:10.200 --> 10:12.760
When there's an event, 
she generally looks something like this.

10:12.760 --> 10:14.010
Oh my.

10:14.590 --> 10:17.800
A beautiful dress that accentuates her 
hair color, and that's all you have to say?

10:17.800 --> 10:19.630
Abel, you never go overboard, do you?

10:19.630 --> 10:21.370
Camilla, Eurie!

10:21.370 --> 10:22.250
And...

10:23.240 --> 10:25.400
Why are you hiding?

10:28.180 --> 10:32.100
<i>L-Lawren is wearing his hair differently!</i>

10:32.420 --> 10:33.550
What's wrong?

10:33.550 --> 10:34.860
N-Nothing!

10:37.840 --> 10:39.910
Um...

10:39.910 --> 10:43.440
There's all sorts of delicious-looking 
food arranged here, isn't there?

10:45.450 --> 10:47.270
It's all fluffy.

10:47.950 --> 10:50.000
Do you mean my hair?

10:50.000 --> 10:52.200
The maids did it for me.

10:52.200 --> 10:55.760
It isn't a style I can do usually, so it's 
got a freshness to it, don't you think?

10:55.760 --> 10:57.920
Yes, it's beautiful.

10:59.170 --> 11:01.680
Oh! That just slipped out!

11:01.680 --> 11:03.000
Is this a dream?

11:03.000 --> 11:05.430
She doesn't seem able to handle it.

11:05.430 --> 11:08.560
I feel like I just had a lovely dream!

11:12.690 --> 11:14.430
Oh, Miss Cecilia!

11:14.430 --> 11:15.970
Shall we go and chat over there?

11:15.970 --> 11:16.810
What?

11:16.810 --> 11:17.570
Hey!

11:17.570 --> 11:19.400
Where are you taking 
the party's guest of honor?

11:19.400 --> 11:20.650
Then...

11:21.120 --> 11:22.820
would you like to come with us?

11:22.820 --> 11:23.650
What?!

11:23.650 --> 11:25.160
Wh-Where are we going?

11:25.160 --> 11:26.710
It'll only be a moment.

11:27.660 --> 11:28.790
So?

11:28.790 --> 11:31.860
What did you want to talk to Cecilia about?

11:31.860 --> 11:34.480
Our previous conversation, of course!

11:34.480 --> 11:38.800
You haven't told me about your 
relationship with Lawrence yet, have you?

11:38.800 --> 11:40.300
On that matter,

11:40.300 --> 11:42.840
you could say that I have nothing to say.

11:42.840 --> 11:45.300
<i>Cecilia can't lie.</i>

11:45.300 --> 11:49.310
<i>I'll have to follow up for her and 
help hide the fact that she's a lady saint!</i>

11:49.310 --> 11:51.310
Well then...

11:51.310 --> 11:53.150
What is the truth of your 
relationship with him?

11:53.150 --> 11:54.960
You aren't simply friends, are you?

11:54.960 --> 11:56.520
Do you live close to each other?

11:56.520 --> 11:58.490
Um... We live together.

11:58.490 --> 12:00.360
You live together?

12:00.360 --> 12:02.560
But you aren't married, are you?

12:02.560 --> 12:03.810
Why are you living together?

12:03.810 --> 12:05.560
That's because... I'm a—

12:05.560 --> 12:09.370
You love Lawrence's cooking so much, 
you just settled in with him, right?

12:09.370 --> 12:10.070
What?

12:10.070 --> 12:13.000
But you love Lawrence, don't you?

12:14.000 --> 12:15.850
It's so easy to tell.

12:15.850 --> 12:19.720
Well, if you live under the same roof, 
something is bound to happen.

12:19.720 --> 12:20.760
It hasn't.

12:20.760 --> 12:21.760
What?

12:21.760 --> 12:23.160
Nothing has happened.

12:24.260 --> 12:25.520
Oh, my.

12:25.520 --> 12:28.220
Lawrence really is quite dense, isn't he?

12:28.220 --> 12:31.180
I wonder if he thinks 
of you as a younger sister.

12:31.180 --> 12:32.000
Hold on!

12:32.000 --> 12:33.520
But...

12:33.520 --> 12:38.020
he told me that he would try 
to call me by my name!

12:38.020 --> 12:39.010
<i>Huh?</i>

12:39.610 --> 12:43.980
<i>Did they make some progress 
that I didn't know about?</i>

12:44.070 --> 12:45.410
<b>Perplexed.</b>

12:45.400 --> 12:48.920
Oh, yes. I have to ask 
something very important.

12:48.920 --> 12:52.420
Miss Cecilia, what do you 
love most about Lawrence?

12:52.420 --> 12:53.160
Ev—

12:53.160 --> 12:54.480
"Everything" is not an acceptable answer.

12:54.480 --> 12:56.580
How did you know?

12:56.580 --> 12:58.610
<i>The most?</i>

12:58.610 --> 13:01.050
<i>The fact that his cooking is so delicious...</i>

13:01.050 --> 13:02.840
<i>or the fact that he's so kind, or...</i>

13:05.090 --> 13:06.390
Miss Camilla.

13:07.090 --> 13:10.850
Is there really a need to ask 
so much about the two of them?

13:10.850 --> 13:14.000
This adorable girl is so worried.

13:14.000 --> 13:15.600
How could I possibly leave her on her own?

13:17.530 --> 13:18.480
Excuse me!

13:19.330 --> 13:21.730
I've narrowed it down to one thing.

13:22.320 --> 13:26.000
Lawren always saves me.

13:26.000 --> 13:28.730
He always holds his hand out to me.

13:28.990 --> 13:32.120
He believes in me so much.

13:32.120 --> 13:36.170
I think that's the thing that I most... lo—

13:38.120 --> 13:39.620
<i>She can't say it!</i>

13:39.620 --> 13:42.350
Can you believe that Lawrence 
can't comprehend this?

13:42.350 --> 13:44.520
Truly, everything he does is regrettable.

13:44.520 --> 13:46.210
Th-That's why...

13:46.210 --> 13:49.540
one day he will understand 
how I feel about him.

13:49.540 --> 13:53.080
I truly believe that, so I don't 
think there's any need to worry.

13:53.080 --> 13:54.440
Truly?

13:54.970 --> 13:57.770
You won't cast Lawrence aside someday?

13:57.770 --> 13:58.850
Cast him...?

13:58.850 --> 14:01.520
Lawrence is just so incredibly dense.

14:01.520 --> 14:04.650
I'm worried that you'll grow 
sick of him, Miss Cecilia.

14:04.650 --> 14:07.860
<i>And that's why she was 
asking so many questions.</i>

14:07.860 --> 14:09.760
That day will never come!

14:10.280 --> 14:12.450
You really are just so adorable!

14:12.450 --> 14:14.240
You make me want to take you home with me.

14:14.240 --> 14:17.200
Could you please refrain 
from being disrespectful toward Cecilia?

14:18.690 --> 14:21.010
Worried about Miss Cecilia?

14:22.000 --> 14:26.340
Miss Hazelita is with her, 
so I think she'll be all right, but...

14:26.340 --> 14:29.520
Oh, yes. Thank you for today.

14:29.520 --> 14:31.740
You're the ones who helped us out.

14:31.740 --> 14:34.550
And you served as my 
conversational partners, too.

14:34.550 --> 14:35.470
That was nothing.

14:35.800 --> 14:39.350
Maybe it's because you're 
in a similar position to ours.

14:39.350 --> 14:41.480
That's why I end up saying 
too much before I realize it.

14:41.880 --> 14:45.410
I hope that your lady 
saint can live in happiness.

14:45.410 --> 14:46.980
She's not really "mine."

14:49.000 --> 14:50.740
That's right.

14:51.040 --> 14:53.740
I'm sure that the lady 
saint will be just fine

14:53.740 --> 14:58.630
because she knows that 
the people around her love her.

15:00.870 --> 15:02.810
Lawren!

15:03.660 --> 15:05.320
You must be hungry.

15:05.320 --> 15:07.920
I picked out a few things 
I thought you might like.

15:09.050 --> 15:10.880
And there are drinks over here!

15:10.880 --> 15:12.190
Oh, thank you!

15:13.380 --> 15:16.220
Miss Cecilia really is lovely, isn't she?

15:16.220 --> 15:19.640
There can't be any girl as easy 
to understand as she is.

15:19.640 --> 15:21.160
Easy to understand?

15:21.160 --> 15:23.870
You are always like that, aren't you?

15:23.870 --> 15:25.230
About what?

15:25.230 --> 15:29.270
Haven't you ever thought of 
Miss Cecilia as adorable?

15:29.270 --> 15:30.120
What?

15:32.580 --> 15:34.340
It's so delicious!

15:34.340 --> 15:38.080
Cecilia, I know that you love 
Lawrence's cooking most of all.

15:38.080 --> 15:41.510
Well, it's true that it wasn't bad.

15:41.510 --> 15:45.960
From tomorrow onward, you'll be 
happily eating his home cooking again.

15:47.160 --> 15:50.840
Hazelita, you can eat it with me, you know?

15:50.840 --> 15:51.770
What?

15:52.200 --> 15:52.960
What?

15:53.340 --> 15:54.590
What?!

15:54.590 --> 15:57.920
Hazelita, you aren't coming back 
with us tomorrow?

15:57.920 --> 15:59.180
This is so sudden.

15:59.180 --> 16:02.360
Now that I think about it, 
I hadn't told you yet, had I?

16:02.360 --> 16:05.420
I just assumed that you'd 
stay with us forever.

16:05.420 --> 16:08.150
It's true that I was very comfortable there.

16:08.150 --> 16:09.900
Hazelita...

16:09.900 --> 16:12.500
Um, I'll be saying goodbye here, too.

16:12.500 --> 16:15.360
Abel, you seem like you'd turn up 
in the house at any moment, so...

16:15.360 --> 16:16.500
Huh?

16:16.500 --> 16:18.800
It's nothing to be sad about.

16:18.800 --> 16:21.910
I'm sure we were only in the way 
while we were around.

16:21.910 --> 16:24.590
That's not true! You were never in the way!

16:24.590 --> 16:27.300
We had fun, the four 
of us together, didn't we?

16:30.130 --> 16:31.800
Yes, we did.

16:33.300 --> 16:35.750
Leaving your friends makes 
you feel lonely, doesn't it?

16:35.750 --> 16:37.880
One can't help feeling sad.

16:37.880 --> 16:40.560
Oh, I've just had a good idea!

16:40.560 --> 16:43.320
You two should just move to this city!

16:43.320 --> 16:45.880
That's such an irresponsible thing to say.

16:45.880 --> 16:47.290
But it's a brilliant idea, isn't it?

16:47.290 --> 16:49.540
Isn't it? Let's do that.

16:49.850 --> 16:52.110
U-Um, that would be...

16:52.110 --> 16:53.150
No.

16:54.400 --> 16:58.530
Our village cannot be 
without the pastor and Miss Cecilia.

16:58.530 --> 16:59.780
Eric.

16:59.780 --> 17:00.810
You're right.

17:00.810 --> 17:03.430
Then, what about just Miss Cecilia?

17:03.430 --> 17:04.410
Camilla?

17:04.620 --> 17:07.780
If you want Lawrence to stay his 
amicable self, then please stop now.

17:07.780 --> 17:08.920
Oh my.

17:09.990 --> 17:12.920
You seem deep in thought there.

17:12.920 --> 17:16.180
There you go, speaking as if you understand 
how someone else is feeling.

17:16.180 --> 17:18.910
This time, you were quite easy to read.

17:20.200 --> 17:24.900
Ever since that happened, 
I've hated getting involved with others.

17:24.900 --> 17:28.400
I devoted myself to things 
like my lessons and studies.

17:28.400 --> 17:33.320
I've grown up without spending time 
with people my own age.

17:33.320 --> 17:39.200
That's why every day I spent with Cecilia 
and the others was so much fun.

17:40.060 --> 17:43.490
Miss, all you've ever done 
is show self-restraint.

17:43.490 --> 17:48.290
I think one selfish 
request would be forgiven.

17:48.290 --> 17:50.640
Don't say that like it's 
such a simple thing.

17:50.640 --> 17:52.750
Right now, in your parents' absence,

17:52.750 --> 17:55.510
who is it that's 
in charge of this house again?

17:57.360 --> 17:59.820
Yes... You're right.

18:02.320 --> 18:05.960
The food was delicious, 
and it was fun, too, wasn't it?

18:05.960 --> 18:07.020
Yes.

18:08.840 --> 18:11.890
Were you able to speak 
with Miss Hazelita a lot?

18:11.890 --> 18:16.480
Yes, but it doesn't change 
this lonely feeling I have.

18:16.480 --> 18:21.750
If I were to be selfish, then I'd like 
to stay like this a little longer.

18:22.210 --> 18:23.750
Yes.

18:31.530 --> 18:33.160
Hazelita?

18:33.160 --> 18:37.850
Brother, would it be all right 
for me to say something selfish?

18:39.010 --> 18:42.000
That you'd like to stay with those two?

18:43.260 --> 18:45.200
But, you know, Hazelita...

18:45.200 --> 18:48.720
it's time for you to start 
thinking about your future.

18:48.720 --> 18:51.720
Can you really afford to 
do something like that now?

18:52.140 --> 18:56.980
I've known what I wanted 
to do since long ago.

18:57.530 --> 19:01.480
I want to act for the 
good of the lady saints.

19:03.440 --> 19:05.990
You really are my little sister.

19:06.360 --> 19:08.370
I have one condition.

19:08.370 --> 19:10.840
Academic tests. Societal manners.

19:10.840 --> 19:13.110
You will take tests in those 
subjects and many others,

19:13.110 --> 19:16.290
and you must score higher 
than a mark that I set.

19:16.290 --> 19:19.130
It will be necessary 
to convince those around us.

19:19.130 --> 19:20.480
You can do that, can't you?

19:21.140 --> 19:22.340
Of course!

19:22.340 --> 19:24.440
I'll even prove that I can get 
a perfect score if you like.

19:24.440 --> 19:25.980
That's good to hear.

19:25.980 --> 19:28.080
We won't make it in time 
for their departure,

19:28.080 --> 19:30.220
but I'll get the tests 
ready as quickly as possible.

19:30.220 --> 19:31.710
And...

19:31.710 --> 19:34.570
you should express your 
gratitude to Lawrence.

19:35.650 --> 19:37.000
I will.

19:37.000 --> 19:38.690
And thank you, too, Brother.

19:40.680 --> 19:45.450
<i>I'm sorry I wasn't able to let you say more 
of what you wanted before now, Hazelita.</i>

19:48.270 --> 19:51.520
Say, Lawrence, I wanted 
your advice about something.

19:51.520 --> 19:52.590
What is it?

19:52.590 --> 19:56.130
If it's something unsavory, 
I'm telling the young miss.

19:56.130 --> 19:58.540
How could you say that 
to the person who hired you?

19:58.800 --> 20:02.090
It's something that means a lot to Hazelita.

20:03.060 --> 20:05.720
I wanted advice about something, too.

20:05.720 --> 20:09.090
Which means this has got to have 
something to do with Saint Cecilia.

20:09.720 --> 20:11.230
I see.

20:11.710 --> 20:17.000
Then perhaps we're all 
thinking the same thing.

20:19.600 --> 20:21.110
Where's Cecilia?

20:21.110 --> 20:23.700
I just walked her to her room.

20:23.700 --> 20:25.010
I see.

20:25.010 --> 20:27.340
Um, Miss Hazelita?

20:27.950 --> 20:31.030
The truth is, the lady saint 
is feeling very lonely.

20:31.030 --> 20:34.410
She's talking about how she has to be apart 
from the first friend she ever made.

20:34.730 --> 20:36.160
If you wouldn't mind,

20:36.160 --> 20:39.320
would it be possible for you to stay 
with the lady saint for a while longer?

20:41.920 --> 20:43.910
I was about to ask if I could do just that.

20:49.300 --> 20:53.720
Isn't it wonderful that Miss 
Hazelita will be able to visit again?

20:53.720 --> 20:54.780
And Abel, too.

20:54.780 --> 20:55.890
Yes!

20:55.890 --> 20:59.070
I wasn't able to sleep very well last night,

20:59.070 --> 21:01.440
but now I'll be able to sleep soundly.

21:01.440 --> 21:03.440
L-Lady Saint?

21:03.760 --> 21:05.690
<i>After coming to this city...</i>

21:05.790 --> 21:07.820
<i>so many things happened.</i>

21:08.610 --> 21:10.450
<i>And even more than before...</i>

21:10.910 --> 21:15.560
<i>I feel like the distance between me 
and Lawren has grown smaller.</i>

21:20.720 --> 21:22.190
<i>Lady saint.</i>

21:22.190 --> 21:24.030
<i>Someone who must be protected.</i>

21:24.500 --> 21:27.270
<i>Grandpa told me all sorts of things, but...</i>

21:27.600 --> 21:30.680
Make sure you don't lose her.

21:30.890 --> 21:34.560
A-And I protect you, too, Lawren.

21:34.990 --> 21:40.070
<i>It's possible that I don't 
really understand lady saints yet.</i>

21:40.160 --> 21:43.730
Haven't you ever thought of 
Miss Cecilia as adorable?

21:48.120 --> 21:51.080
L-Lady Saint?

23:24.280 --> 23:27.450
Do your best on the social manners test!

23:27.450 --> 23:28.710
I'll be rooting for you.

23:29.080 --> 23:32.100
The dance test! I'll be cheering 
you on from the shadows.

23:32.720 --> 23:33.880
And the academic aptitude test, too...

23:34.310 --> 23:37.920
You are a tutor, are you not?

23:37.920 --> 23:39.600
Oh. She noticed.
